  "review": [
    "The hymn is the summons to the heavy-laden: 1:1–4 is Matt 11:28 with 1 Pet 2:24, 2:1–3 is John 19:34 with 1 Cor 15:55–57, 3:1–4 is Isa 45:22 with Ps 51:10, 4:1–4 is John 6:51 with John 7:37, 5:1–4 is Isa 61:1 with Eph 1:7, and 6:1–4 is Heb 3:8 with 2 Cor 6:2.",
    "2:3–4 mirror the print's word split across the line-break (بِالْمَـ / ـوْتِ) by ending the third line on the prefixed preposition בַּמָּ־ and beginning the fourth with the noun הַמָּוֶת; the Hebrew cannot split a word, so the preposition is the seam."
  ]
